      "description": "October Gallery is pleased to present a conversation between the artist Romuald Hazoumè and October Gallery’s Director of Special Projects, Gerard Houghton, held in conjunction with the exhibition Romuald Hazoumè: My Blue Period. The discussion will offer unique insights into Hazoumè’s distinctive art and the ideas that inform his sculptural language. Drawing on the works presented in the exhibition, Hazoumè will reflect on the conceptual, material and cultural frameworks that shape his work, together with the inspirations and concerns that underly his current practice. Romuald Hazoumè at 1-54 Contemporary African Art Fair New works by Romuald Hazoumè will also be presented at Booth S7 at 1-54 Contemporary African Art Fair, Somerset House, Strand — approximately 20 minutes’ walk or 5 minutes by taxi or public transport from October Gallery.",
